<![CDATA[<p class="ql-indent-1" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01" style=""><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for reaching out to the Insperity Leave Administration team.Your email is very important to us!<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01" style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font style="">Please know we are working diligently to get to all emails in the order they are received and will respond as quickly as administratively possible.</font></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm;"><span class="cf01" style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font style=""><b>Note: </b>Effective 11/01/2022 the PDF and online Leave Request and Return-to-Work Notice Forms will no longer be accepted. Please submit a new leave request, initiate an employee(s) Return-to-Work, or upload supporting documentation via the Leave Self-Service portal:&nbsp;</font></font></span><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/leave_of_absence" style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/leave_of_absence</span></a></p><span style="font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
